        "id": 5140
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-20T15:23:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`dest_stops` and `dest_colors` should always be the same size.\n\nOne way to keep that is to move `dest_stops.push_back` down with `dest_colors.push_back`. However, skipping a stop completely is a bit awkward and may lead to other issues.\n\nIt would be better to use some random color here, like `SkColors::kMagenta`. This ensures that all the stops are represented and have an associated color. The use of an out of bounds palette index is already incorrect behavior, so any color will do.",
      "revId": "d9b43056b2cba9434daae9cafcd687ec801a0f61",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
