      "writtenOn": "2026-03-20T15:23:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of returning here and allowing the `paint` state to continue to be whatever was passed in, the `color` here should be set to a probably incorrect and eye catching color, like `SkColors::kMagenta`. The use of an out of bounds palette is already incorrect behavior, so any color will do.",
